1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,467
Many people believe
Coca-Cola made Santa red

2
00:00:03,467 --> 00:00:05,367
in the nineteen thirties.

3
00:00:05,367 --> 00:00:07,300
But look at The Children's Friend,

4
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:09,333
a little book printed
in New York

5
00:00:09,333 --> 00:00:11,333
in eighteen twenty-one.

6
00:00:11,333 --> 00:00:15,300
In one surviving copy,
now at Yale University,

7
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:18,400
Santeclaus is already
wearing a red coat.
